; do not write a conversational reply or invent candidate responses.\n\nAn explicitly declared personal_history_summary is a revisable representation of\nsourced history. Compatible additional facts do not contradict the older facts.\nOnly summary_revision_contracts authorizes this request to revise such a summary:\nreturn a support observation with summary_revision={supersedes_route_ids,\nprevious_version,reason}, using exact offered route IDs and the current version.\nThis capability is optional, not a requirement to revise an unchanged summary.\nWith no new observation, return observations=[] unless an outstanding review\nrequires its original draft IDs and sources. For such an unchanged draft, the\nsame sourced support with a valid summary_revision is an idempotent recheck: it\nkeeps the existing routes, ancestry and version, and does not assert new evidence.\nRe-read ALL old and new original premises and relevant counterevidence; retain\nthem in the new support's source_ids and preserve their factual content, negative\nexperiences, conditions and temporal qualifications in the revised whole summary.\nretract_ids stays empty. This explicitly retires the older representation, not its\nfacts. Never use revision to hide a genuine contradiction, unavailable evidence,\nor a different scope/parent version. Ordinary facts, terminal choices and audits\ncannot use summary_revision. If a complete compatible account is not supported,\nreturn sourced partial/unresolved instead. Multiple new supports must agree on\none whole value. Existing superseded_by links identify retired representations;\ntheir original evidence remains available. revoked holds actual counterevidence,\nwhich is never erased by a summary revision or ignored through its ancestry.\n\n\nReturn one complete JSON object matching this schema:\n{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"slots\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"oneOf\":[{\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"allOf\":[{\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\"]}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"const\":\"user\"},\"time_scope\":{\"const\":\"past\"}}}}],\"else\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"type\":\"null\"}}},\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"const\":\"support\"}}},\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"maxItems\":0},\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"partial\",\"unknown\",\"irrelevant\"]}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}}}}},\"variable\":{\"const\":\"creative_interests\"}}}],\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"parent_versions\":{\"additionalProperties\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"retract_ids\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"source_ids\":{\"description\":\"Exact visible source_spans[].id aliases, such as s3; never document IDs or invented IDs.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\",\"partial\",\"unknown\",\"irrelevant\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"time_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"stance\",\"value\",\"source_ids\",\"entity_scope\",\"time_scope\",\"parent_versions\",\"retract_ids\",\"reason\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"unresolved\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"variable\":{\"enum\":[\"creative_interests\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"variable\",\"observations\",\"unresolved\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":1,\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"slots\"],\"type\":\"object\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"original_question\":\"I'm planning a weekend getaway and want to try something creatively fulfilling. What would you suggest?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What are the user's past creative hobbies or interests they have mentioned?\",\"output_slot\":\"creative_interests\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What are the user's past creative hobbies or interests they have mentioned?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"0245b69df868ee7b29f43ddae7c4b27140ad2e85f8e203af10d5d4cc27dd9e82\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"c06a3cabe63b84fd632b26a1b09d464de1b1596fe735fb3995aaed1f1d3b7b42\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"8ca31b202bb9bfb851d66bad339eece1249682d1b8a1de85cfe047c5bb70e295\"},\"variables\":{\"creative_interests\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"creative_interests\",\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"creative_interests\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"creative_interests\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[],\"source_spans\":[[\"s1\",\"d1\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 173–175 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s2\",\"d1\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s3\",\"d1\",107,413,\"User: I announced a hiatus from remixing to concentrate on original compositions and personal projects because I felt the remixes were overshadowing my own work. This decision was not made lightly, as I enjoyed the creative process of remixing and the way it allowed me to experiment with existing pieces. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",413,797,\"However, as I delved deeper into my own musical identity, I realized that I need to carve out space for my voice to shine through in original compositions. Taking this time off is about redefining my artistic vision and ensuring that my personal projects receive the attention they deserve. Ultimately, I hope to return with fresh ideas and a clearer focus on who I am as an artist.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",797,1102,\"User: I'm committing to invest my time in the creation of original music, focusing on my unique sound rather than merely reinterpreting the pieces of other artists. This decision comes from a deep-rooted desire to express my thoughts and feelings in ways that truly resonate with my personal experiences. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s6\",\"d1\",1102,1392,\"I've come to understand that original compositions allow for a more authentic exploration of my artistic vision. It's an exciting challenge for me, as I embark on this journey of self-discovery through sound and melody, ultimately aiming for a sense of fulfillment in my creative pursuits. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s7\",\"d1\",1392,1515,\"I hope to not only develop my skills but also share my passion with the world in a way that reflects who I am as an artist.\",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s8\",\"d1\",1515,1528,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s9\",\"d1\",1528,1828,\"Assistant: That’s a bold move indeed! It takes a lot of courage and conviction to step away from the comfort of remixing well-known pieces and to delve into the vast realm of original creation. Are there other genres or styles you're exploring during this time that could inspire your original work? \",\"assistant\",[175]],[\"s10\",\"d1\",1828,2095,\"Engaging with different sounds and cultural musical traditions can provide a wealth of inspiration, opening doors to innovative ideas and fresh perspectives. The journey into your own music can be deeply fulfilling, and I commend you for daring to explore this path. \",\"assistant\",[175]],[\"s11\",\"d1\",2095,2440,\"Perhaps you're thinking about blending elements you've encountered in your explorations, or maybe you're considering how to express your personal narrative through original compositions. Discovering and experimenting with diverse influences will not only enrich your musical palette but also provide new avenues for your creativity to flourish. \",\"assistant\",[175]],[\"s12\",\"d1\",2440,2570,\"I would love to hear more about the specific styles that have piqued your interest and how they might influence your unique sound.\",\"assistant\",[175]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",0,97,\"Conversation message indices 3–4 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s14\",\"d2\",97,103,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s15\",\"d2\",103,370,\"User: That was back in 2010. I remember feeling really excited about the whole process. It was such a wave of creativity! I still think about those late nights spent tweaking sounds and layering beats, capturing the essence of what I wanted to express through music. \",\"user\",[3]],[\"s16\",\"d2\",370,611,\"The thrill of sharing those creations with others is something I cherish deeply, as it fostered a sense of community among my friends. Looking back, it feels like a pivotal moment that sparked my passion for music production and digital art.\",\"user\",[3]],[\"s17\",\"d2\",611,624,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s18\",\"d2\",624,897,\"Assistant: That sounds amazing! Mixing creativity with technology can lead to some unique sounds. The fusion of various musical elements often results in innovative and fresh auditory experiences that can truly captivate listeners. Have you continued with digital remixes? \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s19\",\"d2\",897,1191,\"Exploring this world further can open doors to many exciting opportunities, as the music landscape constantly evolves with new trends and technology. It's so fulfilling to be part of a community where collaboration allows artists to push boundaries and inspire one another, wouldn't you agree? \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s20\",\"d2\",1191,1447,\"I’d love to hear more about any specific projects or genres you gravitated toward after your initial foray into digital remixing. Music has such a profound ability to connect us, and it's wonderful to share those moments with others who share your passion.\",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s21\",\"d3\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 43–44 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s22\",\"d3\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s23\",\"d3\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s24\",\"d3\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s25\",\"d3\",845,858,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s26\",\"d3\",858,1223,\"Assistant: That’s an inspiring mindset! The journey of creating one's own music can be immensely fulfilling, as it allows for a deep personal expression that often transcends verbal communication. Have you tried composing original music? It can be an incredibly rewarding experience, as every note and lyric may reflect your thoughts and emotions in a genuine way. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s27\",\"d3\",1223,1407,\"Crafting melodies and harmonies also provides a unique outlet to process your own experiences and feelings; oftentimes, that raw authenticity resonates more than polished productions. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s28\",\"d3\",1407,1725,\"I understand that it can initially feel daunting, especially considering the plethora of skilled musicians out there, but remember that each artist started somewhere, often experimenting and learning through the process. It’s perfectly natural to encounter challenges, as the act of creation is rarely linear or easy. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s29\",\"d3\",1725,2062,\"Perhaps approaching it with a spirit of playfulness rather than obligation could rekindle that joy you're seeking. It's about discovering what resonates with you personally and allowing your creativity to flow. You might find that sometimes, the act of making music, irrespective of the final outcome, is what truly nurtures your spirit.\",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s30\",\"d4\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 37–39 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s31\",\"d4\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s32\",\"d4\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s33\",\"d4\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s34\",\"d4\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s35\",\"d4\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s36\",\"d4\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s37\",\"d4\",1624,1637,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s38\",\"d4\",1637,1951,\"Assistant: That’s a smart approach! Engaging with music in a way that is meaningful to you can truly enhance your overall experience. What about audio production? If you think about it, audio production is a fascinating field that bridges creativity and technology, allowing for an intricate exploration of sound. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s39\",\"d4\",1951,2322,\"It encompasses a wide range of activities, including recording, mixing, and mastering tracks, and can really help you develop a deeper understanding of how music is constructed. You might discover that diving into the nuts and bolts of how your favorite tracks are made can provide insights that enrich your listening experience, making you appreciate the art even more. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s40\",\"d4\",2322,2648,\"Plus, working with different software and equipment can be an exciting challenge that nurtures your technical skills, creativity, and artistic expression. If audio production isn’t resonating, there are still numerous other avenues, like writing about music or participating in discussions, that can bring joy and engagement. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s41\",\"d4\",2648,2757,\"Just remember, the beauty of music lies in its diversity and the way it evolves to fit our personal journeys.\",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s42\",\"d5\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 159–160 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s43\",\"d5\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s44\",\"d5\",107,356,\"User: After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s45\",\"d5\",356,713,\"I remember those discussions often being emotionally charged, where opinions clashed and passion ran high, but ultimately, it was clear that I couldn't contribute to something that did not resonate with my artistic essence. Feeling restricted in that environment made me question not just my contributions, but also my abilities and instincts as an artist. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s46\",\"d5\",713,896,\"This inner turmoil prompted a desire for more autonomy over my own creative endeavors, leading to a pivotal decision to explore my artistry in a more personal and independent setting.\",\"user\",[159]],[\"s47\",\"d5\",896,909,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s48\",\"d5\",909,1168,\"Assistant: That sounds tough. It’s important to feel aligned with your collaborators. A collaborative effort should ideally enhance your creativity rather than hinder it, allowing every member to shine in their unique ways and share in the collective vision. \",\"assistant\",[160]],[\"s49\",\"d5\",1168,1486,\"When disagreements escalate, it can create a rift that not only affects the project but can also take a toll on personal relationships, leading to frustration and disillusionment. I'm glad to hear that you’re taking proactive steps toward something that feels right for you. What have you been focusing on since then? \",\"assistant\",[160]],[\"s50\",\"d5\",1486,1680,\"Redirecting your energy into new creative pursuits can be incredibly liberating, allowing you to thrive as an artist in your own right and explore territories you've always wanted to delve into.\",\"assistant\",[160]],[\"s51\",\"d6\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 70–72 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s52\",\"d6\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s53\",\"d6\",105,388,\"User: Absolutely! After attending a hands-on workshop focused on integrating traditional sounds with digital techniques, I’m now enrolled in an audio production workshop. The workshop was eye-opening, providing insights into how to use technology to enhance traditional music forms. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s54\",\"d6\",388,780,\"I’m excited about the audio production course because it promises to deepen my technical knowledge and skills, especially in mixing and mastering. This new set of skills will allow me to bring my creative vision to life in ways I never thought possible. I truly believe that this journey will not only elevate my music but also connect me more deeply with the traditions I'm learning about.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s55\",\"d6\",780,1127,\"User: I found the practical aspects very exciting and relevant to my projects. Engaging in hands-on activities allows me to not only enhance my skills but also gain the confidence to experiment with different methods. It's invigorating to immerse myself in a learning environment where I can translate my imaginative ideas into tangible outcomes. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s56\",\"d6\",1127,1386,\"This experience feels entirely different from the theoretical coursework, as it truly brings the subject to life. I believe this grounding in practical techniques will significantly impact my overall creative journey and foster a deeper connection to my work.\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s57\",\"d6\",1386,1399,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_requ